Subject: [PATCH] fix: repaint exposed tails at opaque overlay edges

Source: downstream branch fix/overlay-exposed-cell-background
Base: 3d9d2b18dab139ba226ebc5a1c9a9f2c9c3ee4df
Tip: d3cb71ee329509c71b49406d6664512b6c128de1
Applies-to: Herdr v0.9.3 with the Gentoo popup-edge and style-isolation patches

Repaint empty wide-glyph tails exposed immediately right of opaque overlays,
retaining each cell's original style. Leave ordinary ANSI and sparse output
unchanged rather than introducing complete-frame fallback.

Exported as the entire base..tip branch diff, including regression tests.
Uses --unified=1 to avoid context overlap with the independent edge patch.

